=== This version closes a caller-authorisation gap identified in
=== supervisor review: RegisterComponent, RecordTest, RecordShipment,
=== RecordAssembly, RecordDelivery, AttachEvidence, CloseRecall, and
=== RecordUsageLog previously checked only caller-supplied business data
=== (a declared fromOwner string, a declared supplierID, CoAttestingOrgs),
=== never the caller's own authenticated MSP identity. Part A below is the
=== authorised happy path; Part B is one genuine negative case per
=== affected function, each submitted by an enrolled organisation that is
=== NOT authorised for that call.

